  "description": {
   "en": "Sakuta goes on a trip to Shikoku with his dad, Renji, to see if they can find mom, who seems to have gotten lost and can't come back home. In such a historical town, in a house full of memories, where could mom have gone?\n\nA heart-warming family journey through Shikoku, where the family's answer lies at the end.\n\n(Source: GANMA, translated)"
